        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five months have passed since the horrifying tragedy at Arya’s fried rice shop. The place where Valeria, the daughter of his late close friend, mysteriously vanished. Trying to rebuild his life, Arya now works as a nighttime courier. But the guilt and his obsession with uncovering the truth continues to haunt him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One night, a routine delivery brings him to the home of Viktor, a mysterious figure with ties to that dark event. From that moment on, strange things begin happening. Every truth Arya uncovers pulls him deeper into an inexplicable terror, caught between dreams, delusion, and reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is Valeria truly gone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or has Arya’s guilt awakened something that should have remained buried?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Arya</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162300/extras/fbf4003beea903ecbdc4d9b5043c7504.poster.avif?t=1772781213\" width=500 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162300/extras/fbf4003beea903ecbdc4d9b5043c7504.webm?t=1772781213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man ridden with guilt and loss after tragedy struck his late friend's daughter whom he swore to care for</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver Packages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162300/extras/e51c4ce8c2f1f908696bfab3f258b557.poster.avif?t=1772781213\" width=500 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162300/extras/e51c4ce8c2f1f908696bfab3f258b557.webm?t=1772781213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver packages in Arya's nighttime job and experience a brand new driving mechanic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unveil Mysteries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162300/extras/865aea3da16f3b10ed50c2713c2be91d.poster.avif?t=1772781213\" width=500 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162300/extras/865aea3da16f3b10ed50c2713c2be91d.webm?t=1772781213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover mysteries surrounding the disappearance and Arya's past</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A PSX Inspired horror First Person set in the quiet neighborhood in Indonesia</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various endings depending on how you choose your decisions</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience two perspectives: Witness the story through Arya, a guilt-ridden courier, and Viktor, a man guarding a terrible secret.</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver packages in the creepy nighttime atmosphere</strong></p></li></ul>",
